@startuml
title Current enforced lifecycle
[*] --> New
New --> Acknowledged
New --> Cancelled : reason
Acknowledged --> InProgress
Acknowledged --> Resolved
Acknowledged --> Cancelled : reason
InProgress --> Resolved
InProgress --> Cancelled : reason
Resolved --> Reopened : reason; clear current rating/resolution
Reopened --> InProgress
Reopened --> Resolved
Reopened --> Cancelled : reason
Cancelled --> [*]
note right of Acknowledged : First response time set once
note right of Resolved : First resolution retained;
latest resolution is current
@enduml
